---
// Problem section — highlights pain points
---

<section class="w-full bg-surface py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-h1 text-slate-dark text-center mb-12">¿Te suena familiar este caos?</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="bg-surface border border-border-div rounded-card p-6 shadow-custom flex flex-col gap-4 items-start">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-danger/10 flex items-center justify-center text-danger">
                    <!-- file-x-2 icon -->
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4"/><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"/><path d="m8 12.5-5 5"/><path d="m3 12.5 5 5"/></svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-body text-slate-dark">Planillas de Excel desactualizadas a fin del día.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="bg-surface border border-border-div rounded-card p-6 shadow-custom flex flex-col gap-4 items-start">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-danger/10 flex items-center justify-center text-danger">
                    <!-- alert-triangle icon -->
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"/><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/></svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-body text-slate-dark">Vender en el local y olvidar bajar el stock en Tiendanube (quiebres online).</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Card 3 -->
            <div class="bg-surface border border-border-div rounded-card p-6 shadow-custom flex flex-col gap-4 items-start">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-danger/10 flex items-center justify-center text-danger">
                    <!-- clock-4 icon -->
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-body text-slate-dark">Tus empleados perdiendo horas cruzando datos manualmente.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
